Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

wifit3 (https://github.com/derv82/wifit3)
    Copyright (C) derv82 and contributors.
    Licensed under GPL-2.0-only.
    The optional live path imports wifit3's USB driver layer and WSC codec at
    runtime; it is not bundled with pixie.  Because pixie is distributed for
    use together with wifit3, the combined work is licensed under GPL-2.0.

pixiewps (https://github.com/wiire-a/pixiewps)
    Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later.
    Optional, external binary (built by install.sh); pixie only invokes it.

pyusb (https://github.com/pyusb/pyusb)
    BSD-3-Clause.  Optional dependency of the live path, not bundled.

libusb (https://libusb.info/)
    Version 1.0.30, LGPL-2.1-or-later.  Bundled as prebuilt Android binaries
    (app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libusb-1.0.so and
    app/src/main/jniLibs/armeabi-v7a/libusb-1.0.so), taken unmodified from the
    Termux project's official package repository (packages.termux.dev,
    libusb_1.0.30_aarch64.deb and libusb_1.0.30_arm.deb, SHA-256 verified).
    libusb is used as a shared library, loaded at runtime, so it can be
    replaced by the user; the app's own code is not a derivative of it.
